  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 1 is the longest at Heritage Park at 330 feet — a wooded opener that tells you exactly what the course is about before you've played a second hole. A clean line through the trees, a guarded green, and the rest of the round follows the same honest pattern. It's the hole that sets the tone.",
